    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We strongly encourage you to visit no 1 The fairways, a beautifully appointed new home.In an exceptional development of only 9 luxury homes, with unrivalled amenities. An Attractive, A rated, newly built two-storey 4 bedrooms detached home with a contemporary finish, featuring a warm brick façade, rendered upper walls, dark tiled roof and modern windows.The Property includes a spacious paved driveway, landscaped frontage, private rear garden and paved patio area, offering excellent kerb appeal and low-maintenance outdoor space.\r\nIdeally located on Drumree Road, the property is close to an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, including Dunshaughlin Community College. Dunshaughlin offers a wide range of shops, cafes, healthcare and community services, together with parks, playgrounds and extensive sporting facilities, making it particularly attractive location for families.\r\n Contact John Bannon – john@bannonauctioneers.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Canelo Developments \r\nManagement  Company - Canelo Developments will maintain for 1yr before taking in charge by Meath Co Co. It will be up to residents to set up a management association thereafter to cut grass/maintain soft landscaping"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A Rated Dwelling \r\nHeat Pump with Rads throughout and High Spec Sanitary Ware\r\nHeating system is air to water heat pump with radiators throughout with 3nr zones. Ventilation will be demand control ventilation.\r\nOrnate Grey Windows by Grady Joinery.\r\nElegant, high quality fitted kitchens and wardrobes. \r\nStylish bathrooms with attractive range of high-quality sanitary ware.\r\nBlack uPVC Fascia & Soffit / Gutters & Down Pipes\r\nGranite string course and window cills to front elevation\r\nKitchen / Wardrobes – supplied and fitted by BeSpace \r\nTiling – All Wall tilling & Shower area complete\r\nMixture of wood floors and carpet complete\r\nGardens Levelled and seeded\r\nSide gate, iron rails (supplied by renowned local Foley forge steel works)\r\n138 sqm"
      },
      {
